                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Welcome, young Wizard! I've heard from dear Moolinda Wu that you're qualified to learn the Gnomes! spell. Congratulations!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Gardening_Mole.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Farley_ZFA_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 346179,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-SHOP-GARDEN_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "What can I tell you about Gnomes? Let's see... they're earth spirits, quite shy, and able to move through the ground itself!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Gardening_Mole.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Farley_ZFA_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 346179,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-SHOP-GARDEN_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "It is said they guard underground treasure, but they often aid gardeners and protect the grounds they're placed upon.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Gardening_Mole.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Farley_ZFA_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 346179,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-SHOP-GARDEN_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "From time to time, Gnomes fall prey to wanderlust, and travel the worlds far and wide, sending back photos of their travels!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Gardening_Mole.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Farley_ZFA_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 346179,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-SHOP-GARDEN_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Gnomes seem harmless, but when roused to anger they can put up quite the fight. Do not underestimate Gnomes!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Gardening_Mole.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Farley_ZFA_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 346179,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-SHOP-GARDEN_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I hope that I've grounded you... no pun intended... with the lore of the Gnomes. Best wishes to you with your spell!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Gardening_Mole.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Farley_ZFA_06.mp3",
